OL,3,GNEWSATrain station to mark World
OL,4,ASuicide Prevention Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA five-day programme activities has
OL,7,Fbegun at Wolverhampton's railway
OL,8,Fstation to support people's mental
OL,9,Fhealth and wellbeing.
OL,11,FWellbeing Week has been timed to
OL,12,Fcoincide with Thursday's World Suicide
OL,13,FPrevention Day and is a collaboration
OL,14,Fbetween West Midlands Railway and
OL,15,FRethink Mental Illness.
OL,17,FThe event is being held at The Hub at
OL,18,Fthe station, which opened in May last
OL,19,Fyear to help people in crisis, and
OL,20,Factivities include poetry performances,
OL,21,Fgardening workshops, art and music.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
