OL,3,GNEWSATrain station to mark World
OL,4,ASuicide Prevention Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors would be offered personal
OL,7,Fsupport and information, West Midlands
OL,8,FRailway said while Kirsten Rose from
OL,9,FRethink Mental Illness said it was
OL,10,Fabout raising awareness and normalising
OL,11,Fconversations about mental health.
